["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">界</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>世界；边界</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">世界</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">世界；社会；宇宙；领域；圈子；（某一）界；世界闻名的；享誉世界的；（佛教）佛国；一佛所统摄的世界</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">限界</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">げんかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">极限；界限；限度</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">境界</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">边界；边界线；界限；边缘</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">文</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>文章；文学；风格；装饰；花纹</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ブン・モン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふみ・あや</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">作文</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さくぶん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">写作（文章、散文等）；作文；空洞的正式文章；形式化的写作</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">文章</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">文章；作文；文笔；写作风格；句子</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">文化</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">文化；文明；文化年间（1804年2月11日至1818年4月22日）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">元</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>开始；起源；原本</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゲン・ガン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">もと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">元気</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">げんき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">有精神；健康</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">元</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もと</span><span class=\"k-wz\">起源；源头；开端；基础；基底；根基；根本；原因；起因；（原）材料；原料；配料；底料（如蛋糕用）；高汤；己方；自己一边；本金；本钱；成本价；（植物的）根；（树的）主干；（笔、筷子等的）握持部分；柄部；和歌的前三句；（植物或树木的计数单位）株；棵；（鹰猎中鹰的计数单位）只</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">元々</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もともと</span><span class=\"k-wz\">原来；从一开始；从头；本来；天生；不变；依旧；仍然如前</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">重</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>沉重；重要；重叠；层叠；重视</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジュウ・チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">え・おも.い・おも.り・おも.なう・かさ.ねる・かさ.なる・おも</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">重い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おもい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">沉重；重；沉闷；压抑；郁闷；忧郁；不安；缓慢；迟缓；笨重；笨拙；重要；重大；严肃；严重；严厉；严重；危急；病情严重；稳固；稳重；庄重；明智</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貴重</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きちょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">珍贵；宝贵</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">重視</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅうし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">重视；看重；重点关注；强调</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">近</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>近；接近；近似；近期；将近</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キン・コン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ちか.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">近い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">近的；距离短的；近的；即将的；关系近的；亲密的；亲缘近的；近亲的；近似的；接近的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">近く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちかく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">近处；附近；将近；接近；不久；即将</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">近所</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きんじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">邻近；附近；周围</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">考</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>考虑；思考</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かんが.える・かんが.え</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">考える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんがえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">思考；思量；思索；沉思；反思；冥想；考虑；顾及；体谅；纳入考量；认为；相信；持有看法；判断；得出结论；猜想；打算；想要；计划；预测；预期；预想；设想；想出；想到；构思；筹划；设计；视为；看作；当做；认定；看待</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">考え</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんがえ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">思考；想法；观点；意见；概念；主意；念头；想象；意图；计划；设想；考虑；判断；斟酌；反思；希望；盼望；期望</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">考慮</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうりょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">考虑；斟酌</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">海</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>海；海洋</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">うみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">海</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">海；洋；水域</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">海岸</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいがん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">海岸；海滨；滨海；海边；沙滩</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">海外</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいがい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">国外；海外；异国</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">売</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>卖；出售</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">バイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">う.る・う.れる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">売る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">销售；出售；背叛；出卖；使自己出名；树立声誉；挑衅；挑起；强加于人</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">売り場</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うりば</span><span class=\"k-wz\">销售区；柜台；（商场的）楼层；部门；（商品的）畅销时机；好卖的时候</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">商売</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうばい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贸易；商业；买卖；职业；行业；工作</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">知</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>知道；告知；智慧</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">し.る・し.らせる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">知る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">知道；了解；意识到；得知；发现；感觉；感受；察觉；意识到；理解；领会；掌握；体会；记得；熟悉；认识；经历；经受；体验（如艰辛）；认识（某人）；结识；与……有关；与……相关；是某人分内之事；是某人的责任</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">承知</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">知晓；知悉；接受；同意；答应；应允；遵从；认可；原谅；宽恕；包容</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">知らせる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しらせる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">通知；告知；让人知道</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">道</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>道路；街道；地区；路程；道德</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ドウ・トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">みち・いう</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">道</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">道路；小径；街道；巷道；通道；路线；路途；距离；旅程；途径；进程；生活方式；正道；道德准则；教义；教诲；学说；领域；学科；专业；手段；方法；办法</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">柔道</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅうどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">柔道</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">水道</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すいどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">自来水</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">集</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>聚集；集合；收集；群集；汇集</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あつ.まる・あつ.める・つど.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">集まる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あつまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">聚集；汇集；集合</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">集める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あつめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">收集</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">集団</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうだん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">集团；团体；群体</span></li></u